					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/manymeats" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2104082); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2104082&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607200941" alt="ManyMeats" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2104082)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/manymeats" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2104082); return false;" >ManyMeats</a></span> <span class="odate time_1565910930 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">15 Aug 2019 23:15</span>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4331706">
									

<p>Respectfully I think either I may have failed to get my entire point across or you may have missed some of what I was putting down.</p>
<p>Hell is not open. What we know to be the idea of a Christian &quot;Hell&quot; is actually more akin to Hades, it is a place of waiting for judgment. Gehenna is the place of final torture that God will condemn the wicked to, and that is not actually open until Judgment Day.</p>
<p>Gehenna is unknown to man until judgment. SCP-4702 is the place of waiting before it where those not truly worthy of being immediately granted heaven are forced to consider their sins and reflect before their final sentence is levied. Our MTF agent never actually reaches the other shore.</p>
<p>Nonetheless, I appreciate your feedback immensely and thank you for taking the time to read my piece.</p>

							</div>

								
